<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0048_D02FS0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When the sun go down, CLEFAIRY come\nout to play. They dance. In a circle.\fIt’s a cult.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0048_D02FS0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You tired from climbin’? I sell snacks\nin a CAVE. Prices reflect that.\fWanna stock up? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
